   "description": "A bright indoor community pool with tall windows, a wall clock, and a string of colourful pennant flags along the back wall. A lifeguard in red watches from a tall ladder chair on the right, a swimmer front-crawls down the middle lane, an instructor teaches two kids holding flutter boards in the shallow end on the left, and a child stands at the edge of the diving board above them. In the foreground, a parent sits on a bench beside a striped towel.",
